            "description": {
              "value": "When you use a full-power Megaton Strike, you can knock your foe back. When you succeed at your Strike while using an unstable Megaton Strike, your target must attempt a Fortitude save against your class DC.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature is pushed back 5 feet.\n- **Failure:** The creature is pushed back 10 feet.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is pushed back 20 feet."
